  "body": "Given that it's now been years since we killed off the Java binding side of things (and there can't be any other kind of binding but an ES binding for this spec), it's time to seriously consider merging together the type definitions with the binding instructions. \n\nHaving used this spec on a daily basis for years now, it's getting tiresome that I need to constantly jump from the type definition to the binding details by going through the TOC. \n",
